  <ScenTitle>Albania Strikes Again, 1984</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;NOTE: THIS SCENARIO HAS AIRCRAFT DAMAGE AND THUS REQUIRES CHAINS OF WAR TO FUNCTION.&lt;/P&gt;
